SUMMARY:Polish Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261104T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261104T153000
UID:696ba4606724c63d00ecaf8b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Polish Reading Club. A meeting and conversation with those who
  read in Polish. It doesn't matter what you read\;  books or magazines\, 
 fiction or popular science. Come and tell us what you are reading and why.
 \nIt's a wonderful opportunity to hear about reading passions and a place 
 to meet new friends.\nKlub czytajacych po polsku. Spotkanie i rozmowa z ty
 mi co czytaja po polsku.
LOCATION:Long Branch\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/696ba4606724c63d00ecaf8b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
