BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Frauds & Scams
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260824T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260824T120000
UID:6a725ac680e8ce26a95466b0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:How to protect yourself from scams\nPresented by 33 Division C
 rime Prevention Officer. The best way to prevent financial crimes is to be
  aware of them. Learn more about the common types of frauds and scams\, an
 d how to protect yourself and your loved ones.\nRemember\, you may be a ta
 rget\, but you don't have to be a victim.\nDrop-in only.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a725ac680e8ce26a95466b0
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Poetry Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T150000
UID:6a7b7d58be1482002986a238@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a creative afternoon of poetry and discussion
 . Bring in your original poems or poems that you admire. Share your word
 s in a supportive atmosphere\, respond to the poems of others\, receive wr
 iting tips\, and explore the works of a wide range of contemporary poets.\
 nThis is a drop-in program\, no registration required.
LOCATION:Taylor Memorial\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7b7d58be1482002986a238
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
