DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260916T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260916T160000
UID:6a7e43813b6c71003e58b83e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn the basics of apps in this beginner-friendly class. Disc
 over what apps are\, where to find them\, how to safely download and delet
 e them\, and the difference between free\, paid\, and pre-installed apps.\
 nDrop-in attendees are welcome.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe perso
 nal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library un
 der the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The inf
 ormation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery a
 nd evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your information ca
 n be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\,
  789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Gerrard/Ashdale
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7e43813b6c71003e58b83e
