DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive painting workshop that encourages c
 reativity\, social connection\, and confidence through a fun and guided ex
 perience. Participants will create a collaborative artwork by painting in 
 pairs\, combining imagination with simple step-by-step instruction. No exp
 erience is needed. The focus is on enjoyment\, creativity\, and meaningful
  social interaction in a relaxed environment.\nThis program is intended fo
 r Older Adults.\nDrop in.\nMaximum attendance is 16.
