DESCRIPTION:Calling all Seniors! Come chat and make friends in a warm and 
 welcoming place.\nActive and Connected Seniors is a drop-in program in col
 laboration with Culturelink\, hosting plenty of fun activities such as:\nA
 rts & Crafts\nBingo\nFalls Prevention\nand many more!\nDrop in program. No
  registration required.
