BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tea and Entertainment
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260911T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260911T160000
UID:6a773551f4e5db3d00c74a1a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film.  Ingredient lists will
  be available upon request\nSecrets of Sacred Architecture\nExplore how sa
 cred buildings once stood at the forefront of engineering and artistic ach
 ievement\, from towering churches to incredibly complex organs. Discover t
 he design elements that make religious architecture so captivating and the
  deeper meanings these structures express. Did you know there is a gargoyl
 e on the Washington National cathedral that looks like Darth Vader? 55 min
 utes. 2022
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a773551f4e5db3d00c74a1a
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
