DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260924T143000
UID:6a5e80b7b3cbc0a63e99e6d0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join the Toronto Fire Services for a presentation on fire safe
 ty and emergency preparedness.\nLearn how to prevent home fires\, understa
 nd common causes\, plan safe escapes for special needs\, know when and how
  to call for help\, and stay safe in high-rise buildings.\nDrop-In. No Reg
 istration Required.
LOCATION:Weston\, Program Room\, Basement Level
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a5e80b7b3cbc0a63e99e6d0
