UID:6a7746dc4523092f0035acda@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film. Ingredient lists will 
 be available upon request.\nNatural Fear Factor\nA daring mission to retur
 n rare African wild dogs to Gorongosa National Park uncovers the powerful 
 role predators—and the fear they create—play in keeping nature in bala
 nce. Closed Captions. 53 minutes. 2020
