DESCRIPTION:This program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn n
 ew skills\, and have fun. Meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us
  about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood!\n
 Come and join the F.R.E.S.H. group for a Saturday screening of popular mov
 ies.\nWe'll be playing the following films\nOctober 3rd –\nThe Hurrican
 e\nOctober 10th –\nThe Talented Mr. Ripley\nOctober 17th –\nA Simple P
 lan\nOctober 24th –\nScent of a Woman\nOctober 31st –\nThe Silence of
  the Lambs\nDrop in\, no registration is required.\nSnacks and refreshment
 s are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available at
  the program.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Cent
 re's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
