DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261020T200000
UID:6a84c31960ccaf01c01f27a4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you enjoy Gardening? Novice or expert\, join us on the thir
 d Tuesday of the month at 7 pm for an hour of Gardening talks.\nOct 20  
        Autumn in the Garden  a Master Gardener presentation\nMov 17
         TBC\nDec  15        TBC
LOCATION:Taylor Memorial\, Meeting room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a84c31960ccaf01c01f27a4
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
