DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260826T143000
UID:6a6a5cbe3f18b57d5231c0d9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join other seniors at the Downsview branch every Wednesday aft
 ernoon for coffee\, crafts\, games\, and social activities!\nAugust 5:\nNa
 tureTO: Managing Invasive Plants Around Your Home\nAugust 12:\nPuzzles & G
 ames\nAugust 19:\nBingo\nAugust 26:\nPersonalized Stationery
