DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260824T143000
UID:6a83766957c264087ad1c804@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:New to investing? Learn the basics of this important part of f
 inancial literacy\, including how to save with the goal of investing\, typ
 es of investments\, how to open an account\, types of accounts\, how to av
 oid financial fraud and scams\, and more.\nPresented by\nCanadian Investme
 nt Regulatory Organization (CIRO)\n\, a national self-regulatory organizat
 ion that oversees all investment dealers\, mutual fund dealers and trading
  activity on Canada’s debt and equity marketplaces.\nFree program.
