DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261006T200000
UID:6a85e17a2d60e40d5b5b6269@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn to make smarter decisions as a consumer when buying wine
  in a store or in a restaurant. Sommelier Christopher Lafleur will make ap
 proaching a wine list (and the ritual around the first taste) make so much
  more sense by breaking down what is on labels\, teaching what terms are u
 seful\, and what terms don't mean anything.\nDrop-in\, but space is limite
 d.\n*\nSpecial guest for the\nTuesday Cards and Chitchat program.
LOCATION:Guildwood
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a85e17a2d60e40d5b5b6269
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
