DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260925T150000
UID:6a7e113fb20478002992af85@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:At least 1 in 3 women and 1 in 5 men will suffer from a fragil
 ity fracture in their lifetime. Join a volunteer facilitator from Osteopor
 osis Canada and learn how to improve your bone health\, reduce your risk o
 f osteoporosis and related fractures by exploring the following:\nWhat you
  need to know about bone health and osteoporosis\nThe risk of fracturing a
  bone\nHow to maintain healthy bones\nImpact of nutrition & physical activ
 ity Fall prevention
LOCATION:St. Clair/Silverthorn\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7e113fb20478002992af85
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
