 Years\nby Shubnum Khan. Copies are available at the Annette branch.\nThe t
 itle is also available as an eBook or eAudiobook on Libby/Overdrive - sear
 ch tpl.ca or ask us at the desk.\nThe Annette Book Club meets on the last 
 Tuesday of every month. New attendees are always welcome! Drop-in\, no reg
 istration required.\nThe Djinn Waits A Hundred Years
LOCATION:Annette Street
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a6a183a4523092f00336075
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
