DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260901T193000
UID:6a78a9201d5d03c3a6bb86e8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come on in and join the Knitting Group where you can work on y
 our crochet and knitting projects while getting to know the rest of the gr
 oup and share other common interests.\nPLEASE NOTE: Crochet & Knitting is 
 cancelled Tuesday August 25th due to the Election.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
