 ernadette?\nby Maria Semple\nSeptember 24 -\nMinistry of Time\nby\nKaliane
  Bradley\nOctober 29 -\nGreat Believers\nby\nRebecca Makkai\nNovember 26 -
 \nBlack Wolf\nby\nLouise Penny
