DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T153000
UID:6a7de7e43b6c71003e589bb7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Practice your English conversation skills in a relaxing enviro
 nment while making new friends and learning what the library has to offer!
 \nIntermediate learners welcome. Please note that this is not a formal Eng
 lish class.\nEnglish Conversation Circle meets every Monday in September.\
 nWhile registration is not required it is recommended to secure your spot.
  Please register on tpl.ca or call 416-396-8943.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Main Program Room\, 1st Floor
