 ly program is a fun and calming way to explore your creativity and leave w
 ith a finished piece to take home.\nIf you identify as a person with a dis
 ability or as a person who is Deaf\, and require an accessibility accommod
 ation to participate in this program\, please contact Accessibility Servic
 es by email\naccessibleservices@tpl.ca\n\, or voicemail\, 416-393-7099\, t
 o make a request. Please contact us at least three weeks in advance.\nInfo
 rmation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is colle
