DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T150000
UID:69e3a8adf29b90618efeb9a8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for fun and friendly Bingo games at the library.\nMeet
  up with others and try your chance at getting to shout BINGO! Everyone is
  welcome\, no experience required\, we play just for fun.\nThis is a drop-
 in program and everyone is welcome.\nRuns monthly. We will be taking a br
 eak in December.
LOCATION:Richview\, Room A (2nd floor)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e3a8adf29b90618efeb9a8
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
