BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Older Adult Crafternoon: Tie-dye tote bags
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260828T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260828T153000
UID:6a513edf4523092f002f1b45@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us to create a custom and vibrant coloured tote bag using
  dye and rubber bands. The end result will be a reusable bag for shopping\
 , groceries\, the beach or essentials. Craft will be made at the branch ho
 wever\; customers will take the item home for the drying process\n.\nNo ex
 perience needed.\nThis program is for ages 55+\nRegister at tpl.ca or by c
 alling 416-396-8943
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Multipurpose Room\, 1st floor.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a513edf4523092f002f1b45
