DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261026T193000
UID:6a7617d388e9bf2800363be6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:​Have fun learning a new instrument - the ukulele! In week o
 ne\, music teacher Meghan Gallant will join us to teach the fundamentals o
 f ukulele playing: the parts of a ukulele\, tuning\, strumming patterns\,
  and some basic chords. In weeks two and three\, we will practice the skil
 ls we learned and play songs together. Beginner friendly\, no previous ex
 perience is necessary. Ukuleles provided. Registration is required for wee
 k one\, but unregistered participants with their own ukuleles and some ex
 perience are welcome to join for weeks two and three.\nInformation Collect
 ion Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Tor
 onto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c
