 egin the\nbeading workshop\nSeptember 28 | 6:00–8:00 PM\nContinue\nfelti
 ng\nContinue the\nbeading workshop\nOctober 3 | 10:00 AM–12:00 PM\nWork 
 on\nfelting and beading projects\nOctober 7 | 6:00–8:00 PM\nFeast\nClosi
 ng Circle\nCelebration and completion of the program
