UID:6a77377a4523092f0035a90e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film.  Ingredient lists will
  be available upon request.   .\nMystery of Eels\nThe eel—snakelike\, se
 cretive\, and lined with sharp teeth—remains one of the natural world’
 s great mysteries\, with scientists still unsure where it travels\, how it
  lives\, and even how it dies. Long celebrated in poetry and legend as a s
 trange and alluring creature\, the eel continues to fascinate researchers 
 who are trying to uncover the secrets of its hidden journey. Closed captio
 ns. 60 minutes.2013.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium
