DESCRIPTION:This is the second session in the Digital Privacy 101 series a
 nd is intended for participants who have completed Part 1. Learn practical
  strategies to keep your personal information safe online\, including esse
 ntial digital privacy habits\, creating and managing strong passwords\, an
 d recognizing common online threats such as phishing\, malware\, and hacki
 ng. Gain the knowledge and confidence to make safer choices online.\nRegis
 ter online. Drop-ins welcome if space is available.
LOCATION:Steeles
