BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:No Filter Required. Tips for Great Skin
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260912T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260912T150000
UID:6a7df34e4027d701ebc41cc4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Louise Hidinger. Louise is a PhD chemist and scie
 nce communicator. Louise completed her doctoral research in biological che
 mistry at the University of Toronto and holds a post-graduate certificate 
 in cosmetic formulation science from De Montfort University. She will brin
 g her expertise to debunk whether the beauty products we’re encouraged t
 o buy are necessary and what to do for great skin!
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Multipurpose Room\, 1st floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7df34e4027d701ebc41cc4
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
