DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260925T190000
UID:6a29a42043b41b3d006d582a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drawing upon the vast Canadian songbook\, Jerry Newton and Pet
 er Beamish celebrate our rich musical tapestry - from rock to folk\, to po
 p\, country\, and traditional. Experience their harmony singing and spirit
 ed playing of new arrangements of classic and lesser known gems. Learn the
  stories behind the songs as you listen\, sing\, hum\, or clap along and s
 hare special memories of the timeless tunes of Canada.\nNo advance registr
 ation nor free tickets required. All ages welcome.
