SUMMARY:Simplifying Life: A Guide to Downsizing Your Home
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260914T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260914T120000
UID:6a78cfa9e30fe48459682d32@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a comprehensive information session that will help
  participants navigate the process of downsizing with confidence and clari
 ty. Downsizing is not just about reducing physical clutter\; it's a transf
 ormative journey towards a simpler\, more intentional lifestyle.\nThe pres
 entation will define downsizing and its numerous benefits\, including decl
 uttering living spaces.  It will also explain the steps needed to downsize
  a home. Participants will learn the importance of setting clear goals and
  involving family members early to ensure a smooth transition​.\n*Regist
 ration is required and opens on August 16th @ 9:00 am\nInformation Collect
 ion Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Tor
