DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in how to navigate the internet on your per
 sonal devices with improved privacy and understanding the importance of st
 aying safe using social media? If so\, this is the class for you.\nIn this
  program\, you will:\nHow to use public computing environments with improv
 ed privacy\nNavigate the Internet on your personal devices with improved p
 rivacy\nReduce privacy risks through the use of web browser plug-ins/exten
 sions\nUnderstand the privacy considerations of using social media\nPre-Re
 quisites\n: Some computer experience is\nrequired\n\; the ability to navig
 ate app menus\, browsers\, and desktop computing features is desirable.
