DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260912T120000
UID:6a6e42dacca66c2f00a79190@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us to discuss Orbital\, written by Samantha Harvey\, winn
 er of the 2024 Booker Prize. This novel follows six astronauts over a 24 h
 our period as they orbit around the earth\nLimited copies are available fo
 r pick up at Maryvale Branch or place the book on hold at your convenienc
 e\nThis is a drop in program\, no registration required
LOCATION:Maryvale\, Maryvale Boardroom
