UID:6a6bc5ce88e9bf2800347789@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Siksika filmmaker Sinakson Trevor Solway intimately portrays t
 he lives of Blackfoot men as they navigate identity\, kinship and the comp
 lex expectations of manhood. Through unfiltered moments and revealing conv
 ersations set against the breathtaking landscape of the Prairies\, the fil
 m reimagines what it means to be a Native man.\nSiksikakowan: The Blackfoo
 t Man\nis a profound ode to strength\, vulnerability and love across gener
 ations.\nJoin us for this documentary screening. Thanks to\nThe NFB in Li
 braries\n.\nNote: this film will be screened with English closed captions.
 \nDrop in\, no registration required.
