DESCRIPTION:Have questions about your tablet\, phone\, laptop\, email or a
 n app? Need help with eBooks or other online library services?  Our staff 
 are here to teach you technology tools and concepts in a friendly and casu
 al setting. Please bring your personal device and any questions you may ha
 ve.\nDrop-in\, no registration required.\n20 minute limit during high dema
 nd.\nLonger questions may be referred to a 1 hour book a librarian appoint
 ment.\nPlease note: We cannot assist with hardware or technology repairs o
 n devices.\n* Room changed from Room 301 to Digital Innovation Hub.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Digital Innovation Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3ffc73296ea565de2f1981
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
