DESCRIPTION:A class on basic keyboard functions for absolute beginners wit
 h little or no computer experience.\nIn this second session you will:\nFam
 iliarize yourself through practice with the most essential keyboard functi
 ons (alphabet\, number and symbol keys)\nPractice proper keyboarding postu
 re\nUpon completion of this class students will be able to use a keyboard 
 at a beginner level and know how to go online for additional practice.\nPr
 erequisites: Computer for Beginners 1 or basic mouse skills\nFormat: Hands
 -on with demonstrations\nDrop In
LOCATION:Maryvale\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a4691319ec85be793f11c21
