BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Microsoft Application Series
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260918T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260918T123000
UID:6a88a5fa3b6c71003e5a6edc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in improving your computer skills? Join our
  beginner and intermediate Microsoft Word and PowerPoint classes.\nFriday
  September 4: MS Word Basics: Letter Writing\nFriday September 11: MS Word
  Basics: Flyer\nFriday September 18: PowerPoint Basics\nCourse Objective\n
 At the end of the sessions\, participants will be able to apply MS applica
 tion skills\, including opening and closing a word document and PowerPoint
  applications\, formatting text\, and working with tables\, images and dia
 grams. You will also learn to:\nPractice new skills while you design a fly
 er and presentation slide\nFormat text\, margins\, indents\, headers and  
     footers\nAttach images and videos to word and slides\nCreate bulleted\
 , numbered and sorted lists\nPrerequisites: Basic keyboarding and mouse s
 kills required.\nFormat: Hands-on with demonstrations
LOCATION:Humberwood
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a88a5fa3b6c71003e5a6edc
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
