DESCRIPTION:Calling all older adults! Come join us at Morningside library 
 every month (on the last Tuesday of the month).\nEnjoy a variety of topics
 \, guest speakers\, lively conversation\, & fun activities!\nAugust’s so
 cial features a local professional storyteller\, Adele Koehnke\, will perf
 orm original & upbeat stories\nthat may utilize props\, different characte
 r voices\, & an interactive art component to enhance her storytelling.\nTh
 e audience will be encouraged to use their imaginations to participate too
 !\nLight refreshments will be served!  Drop in!
