UID:6a7748ca9006f7535315d3d6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film. Ingredient lists will 
 be available upon request.\nWilliam and Harry\nAn emotional story of broth
 ers Prince William and Prince Harry\, whose lives were forever shaped by t
 he loss of their mother\, Princess Diana\, under the glare of the public e
 ye. As they grew older and chose different directions\, distance and confl
 ict began to redefine their once-close relationship. Closed Captions. 48 m
 inutes. 2024
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7748ca9006f7535315d3d6
