DESCRIPTION:Seniors Digital Literacy\nis a\n6-week course\ndesigned to bui
 ld your confidence by introducing new skills slowly. At the end of the cou
 rse\, you may not know everything about the internet\, but you will have a
 \nsolid foundation\nof\nnew skills\nand the\nconfidence\nto continue learn
 ing.\nIs This Course Right for You?\nFor seniors: beginners\, with\nvery\n
 limited or\nno\ncomputer experience\n*6 weeks:\nwith 1 class and 1 practic
 e session weekly (practice sessions take place on Thursdays from 2:00-3:30
 pm for the duration of the course)\n*Excluding the week of October 12th du
 e to the holiday closure.\nWhat Will You Learn?\nBasic tools such as the m
 ouse and the keyboard\nHow to search online for information\, services and
  entertainment\nHow to use email to keep in touch with family and friends\
 nThe class is limited to 10 participants.  Please visit Richview Library 
