UID:69f603ae596674bcd583e837@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop-in on the last Thursday of the month for a lively book d
 iscussion led by a librarian!\nRegular and Large Print copies of Septembe
 r's selection\,\nAll's Well\nby Mona Awad\, are now available to pick up f
 rom the first floor reference desk. This title is also available as an eBo
 ok\, as an eAudiobook\, as an Audiobook on CD\, and in Large Print.\nUpcom
 ing Titles:\nSeptember 24 - All's Well by Mona Awad\nOctober 29 - To Be An
 nounced\nNovember 26 - The Lion Women of Tehran by Marjan Kamali\nJanuary 
 28 - To Be Announced\nFebruary 25 - Encampment by Maggie Helwig\nMarch 25 
 - The Tainted Cup by Robert Jackson Bennett
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 2/3\, 2nd Floor
